# WS6-02 (Span bounds with a wrapping end). Sources: spec/appendix-stdlib.md §10
# (spanOf: "bounds-checked (E11211)"); spec/02 §10 (usize arithmetic wraps). `at + n`
# wraps to 1, so a check that only compares the end would pass.
# Expected: runtime fault E11211 on every profile and build line.
profiles: host hosted-amiga hosted-amiga-13
expect: fault E11211
contrast: spanOf(slice<u8>(src, 0, 4), 0xFFFFFFFF, 2) ==> spanOf(slice<u8>(src, 0, 4), 1, 2)
contrast-expect: output
--- contrast-output
1 2
